config XIAOMI_BOOTMONITOR
	tristate "Xiaomi boot monitor"
	depends on MTPROF
	default n
	help
	  Xiaomi boot-time monitor: follows the boot stage sequence recorded
	  by the bootprof logger, keeps a per-stage timeout/error ledger and
	  dumps the ramoops pmsg console plus the bootprof log into the
	  blackbox partition when the unit boots after a boot failure.

	  rodin: blob(6.6 bootmonitor.ko) 反汇编等价重建后 =y 内建；消费
	  bootprof 三件导出（bootprof_lock/get_log_count/get_bootprof_pointer），
	  故依赖 MTPROF。
